  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-editorial\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #34444b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;PingFang SC&#39;, &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 677px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 0; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; text-align: justify; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"><section style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #dce5e1; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; max-width: 100%; padding: 12px 0 24px; text-align: left; width: 100%\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; text-align: left\"><h1 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;PingFang SC&#39;, &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1></section></section><p style=\"color: #34444b; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\"><h2 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;PingFang SC&#39;, &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"><span class=\"cw-layout-section-number\" style=\"background-color: #087f8c; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.7; margin-right: 9px; padding: 1px 8px; vertical-align: 3px\">01</span>留一点时间给自己</h2></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong style=\"font-weight: 750\">从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><blockquote style=\"background-color: #edf7f7; border-left: 1px solid #087f8c; color: #075a63; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: justify\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\"><h2 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#39;PingFang SC&#39;, &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\"><span class=\"cw-layout-section-number\" style=\"background-color: #087f8c; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.7; margin-right: 9px; padding: 1px 8px; vertical-align: 3px\">02</span>让行动变得简单</h2></section><ul style=\"background-color: #f7f9f8; border-left: 1px solid #087f8c; margin: 0 0 15px; padding: 14px 16px 14px 36px; padding-left: 22px; text-align: left\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">留意自己的真实感受</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: #087f8c; border: 1px solid #badbdf; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">时段</th><th style=\"background-color: #087f8c; border: 1px solid #badbdf; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #badbdf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">早晨</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #badbdf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #badbdf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">傍晚</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #badbdf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"background-color: #edf7f7; border-top: 3px solid #087f8c; color: #34444b; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 18px 20px; text-align: justify\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p><section class=\"cw-layout-end-mark\" style=\"line-height: 1.5; padding: 27px 0 8px; text-align: center\"><span style=\"background-color: #e06445; display: inline-block; height: 3px; vertical-align: middle; width: 34px\"></span><span style=\"color: #65767c; display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 10px; vertical-align: middle\">END</span><span style=\"background-color: #087f8c; display: inline-block; height: 3px; vertical-align: middle; width: 34px\"></span></section></section></section>"
}
